SUMMARY:Det Danske Frihedstopmøde
DESCRIPTION:Landsforeningen\n\nArrangeret af Students for Liberty Denmark o
 g Liberal Alliances Ungdom. Det Danske Frihedstopmøde samler det liberale
  Danmark og tilbyder muligheden for at høre internationale talere indenfo
 r filosofi\, idehistorie og policy.\n \nArranged by Students for Liberty D
 enmark and Liberal Alliance Ungdom. The Danish Freedom summit\, gathers th
 e classical liberal Denmark and offers the oppertunity to attend internati
 onal speakers within philosophy\, ideology and policy\n \nProgram:\n10:00 
 - 10:15 Velkommen\n10:15 - 11:15 Eamonn Butler\n11:15 - 12:15 Panel : Otto
  Brøns og Robert Tyler\n12:15 - 13:45 Frokost\n13:45\n\nhttps://www.faceb
 ook.com/events/1558686819070313/
CATEGORIES:Landsforeningen
LOCATION:Kedelhallen\, Nyelandsvej 75A\, 2000 Frederiksberg\, Denmark
GEO:55.684354064049;12.521859080803
URL:https://www.facebook.com/events/1558686819070313/
STATUS:CONFIRMED
END:VEVENT
